{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49069","headline":"蔷薇花 · 李冶","name":"蔷薇花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠融红绽浑无力，斜倚栏干似诧人。\n深处最宜香惹蝶，摘时兼恐焰烧春。\n当空巧结玲珑帐，着地能铺锦绣裀。\n最好凌晨和露看，碧纱窗外一枝新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李冶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49069.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49069","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}